"%1$sWarning:%2$s while \"Keep settings\" is off, deleting the plugin "
"permanently removes all OpenPorte settings, including the shared secret. "
"This cannot be undone. If you plan to reinstall OpenPorte, switch it on and "
"save before deleting the plugin."
msgstr ""
"%1$sIsilumkiso:%2$s ngelixa \"Gcina izicwangciso\" icinyiwe, ukucima i-"
"plugin kususa ngokusisigxina zonke izicwangciso ze-OpenPorte, kuquka "
"isimfihlo esabelwana. Oku akunakubuyiselwa umva. Ukuba uceba ukufaka "
"kwakhona i-OpenPorte, yivule kwaye ugcine phambi kokucima i-plugin."

