#: includes/core.php:1598
msgid "This site does not issue challenges in Custom API mode."
msgstr "Le sayithi ayikhuphi mibuzo kwi-Custom API Mode."

#: includes/settings.php:118
msgid ""
"An Expiration of 0 means a solved challenge never expires. This value is "
"being evaluated for deprecation; the recommended range is 60-14400 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Ukuphela kwexesha kuse-0 kuthetha ukuba umbuzo osombululiweyo awupheli "
"xesha. Eli xabiso lihlola ukuba lisutshwe; i-range ecetyhiswayo yi-60-14400 "
"zee-sekondi."

#. translators: %d is the saved Expiration value, in seconds
#: includes/settings.php:126
#, php-format
msgid ""
"An Expiration of %d seconds can elapse before a slow device finishes solving "
"the challenge. Values below 60 seconds are being evaluated for deprecation; "
"the recommended range is 60-14400 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Ukuphela kwexesha kwe-%d zee-sekondi kungadlula phambi kokuba isixhobo "
"esicothayo sigqibe ukusombulula umbuzo. Amanani angaphantsi kwe-60 zee-"
"sekondi ahlolwa ukuba asutshwe; i-range ecetyhiswayo yi-60-14400 zee-sekondi."

#: includes/settings.php:325
msgid "General"
msgstr "Jikelele"

#: includes/settings.php:332
msgid "API Mode"
msgstr "Imo ye-API"

#: includes/settings.php:338
msgid ""
"Select the API Mode. Use Self-hosted to generate challenges on this site, or "
"Custom to point to your own ALTCHA-compatible backend."
msgstr ""
"Khetha i-API Mode. Sebenzisa i-Self-hosted ukuze uvelise imibuzo kule "
"sayithi, okanye i-Custom ukuze ukhombe kwi-backend yakho ehambelana ne-"
"ALTCHA."

#: includes/settings.php:340
msgid "Self-hosted"
msgstr "Self-hosted"

#: includes/settings.php:355
msgid "REST API"
msgstr "REST API"

#: includes/settings.php:356
msgid "Ajax (admin-ajax.php)"
msgstr "Ajax (admin-ajax.php)"

#: includes/settings.php:367
msgid "Self-hosted transport"
msgstr "Indlela yothutho ye-Self-hosted"

#: includes/settings.php:378
msgid "Only used in Self-hosted API Mode."
msgstr "Isetyenziswa kuphela kwi-Self-hosted API Mode."

#. translators: %1$s and %2$s are the opening and closing tags of a link to the OpenPorte documentation.
#: includes/settings.php:385
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Choose how this site serves challenges to visitors. REST API is the default; "
"use Ajax if a security plugin blocks the REST API for logged-out visitors. "
"After changing it, test a protected form in a private window.<br/>%1$sHow to "
"choose and check the transport%2$s"
msgstr ""
"Khetha indlela le sayithi enikezela ngayo imibuzo kubatyeleli. I-REST API "
"yeyokuqala; sebenzisa i-Ajax ukuba i-plugin yokhuseleko ivala i-REST API "
"kubatyeleli abangangenanga. Emva kokuyitshintsha, vavanya ifomu ekhuselweyo "
"kwifestile yabucala.<br/>%1$sIndlela yokukhetha nokujonga indlela "
"yothutho%2$s"

#: includes/settings.php:399
msgid "Challenge URL"
msgstr "I-URL yombuzo"

#: includes/settings.php:407
msgid ""
"Only available when API Mode is set to Custom.<br/>The URL is made up of the "
"domain and path to your <strong>custom ALTCHA-compatible backend</strong>, "
"and optionally an API key (it starts with <code>gk_</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Iyafumaneka kuphela xa imo ye-API isetingwe kwi-Custom.<br/>I-URL yakhiwe "
"nge-domain kunye ne-path ye-<strong>backend yakho ehambelanayo ne-ALTCHA</"
"strong>, kwaye ngokukhetha i-API key (iqala nge-<code>gk_</code>)."

#: includes/settings.php:416
msgid "Shared secret"
msgstr "Isimfihlo esabelwana"

#: includes/settings.php:424
msgid "A secret key used to sign and verify challenges."
msgstr "Ikhodi yimfihlo esetyenziswa ukutshatisa nokuqinisekisa imibuzo."

#: includes/settings.php:427
msgid ""
"OpenPorte generates a random secret automatically. Change it only if another "
"application needs to use the same secret.<br/>In Custom API Mode, this value "
"<strong>must exactly match</strong> the shared secret (sometimes called the "
"HMAC secret) configured in your backend."
msgstr ""
"I-OpenPorte ikhiqiza isimfihlo esingaqikeleleki ngokuzenzekelayo. Sishintshe "
"kuphela ukuba enye i-application idinga ukusebenzisa isimfihlo esifanayo.<br/"
">Kwi-Custom API Mode, eli xabiso <strong>kufuneka lihambelane ngqo</strong> "
"nesimfihlo esabelwana (ngamanye amaxesha sibizwa ngokuba sisimfihlo se-HMAC) "
"esicwangcisiweyo kwi-backend yakho."

#: includes/settings.php:429
msgid ""
"The \"Copy shared secret\" icon button copies the current secret to the "
"clipboard. The \"Generate new shared secret\" icon button fills in a fresh "
"random secret; it only takes effect when you save changes, and challenges "
"already issued with the old secret then stop verifying. In Custom API Mode, "
"saving a new secret also breaks verification of new submissions until you "
"update the secret on your backend to match."
msgstr ""
"Iqhosha lomfanekiso \"Kopa isimfihlo esabelwana\" likopa isimfihlo sangoku "
"kwi-clipboard. Iqhosha lomfanekiso \"Yenza isimfihlo esabelwana esitsha\" "
"lizalisa isimfihlo esitsha esingaqikeleleki; sisebenza kuphela xa ugcina "
"utshintsho, kwaye imibuzo esele ikhutshwe ngesimfihlo esidala iyayeka "
"ukuqinisekiswa. Kwi-Custom API Mode, ukugcina isimfihlo esitsha "
"kukwathintela ukuqinisekiswa kokungeniswa okutsha de uhlaziye isimfihlo kwi-"
"backend yakho ukuze sihambelane."

#: includes/settings.php:439 includes/settings.php:445
msgid "Hash algorithm for the challenges."
msgstr "I-algorithm ye-hash yemibuzo."

#: includes/settings.php:439
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "I-Algorithm"

#: includes/settings.php:446
msgid ""
"In Self-hosted API Mode this is the algorithm used to generate and verify "
"the proof-of-work challenges.<br/>In Custom API Mode it must match the "
"algorithm your backend uses — most ALTCHA-compatible backends default to "
"SHA-256."
msgstr ""
"Kwi-Self-hosted API Mode le yi-algorithm esetyenziswa ukukhiqiza "
"nokuqinisekisa imibuzo ye-proof-of-work.<br/>Kwi-Custom API Mode kufuneka "
"ihambelane ne-algorithm e-backend yakho esiyisebenzisayo — i-backends "
"ezininzi ehambelanayo ne-ALTCHA zisebenzisa i-SHA-256 ngokwemveli."

#: includes/settings.php:456
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Ephantsi"

#: includes/settings.php:457
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Epakathi"

#: includes/settings.php:458
msgid "High"
msgstr "Ephezulu"

#: includes/settings.php:468
msgid "Complexity"
msgstr "Ubunzima"

#: includes/settings.php:478
msgid "Disabled in Custom mode: the backend sets the challenge complexity."
msgstr "Icinyiwe kwi-Custom mode: i-backend isetinga ubunzima bombuzo."

#: includes/settings.php:479
msgid ""
"Select the PoW complexity for the widget: the higher the complexity, the "
"longer visitors (and bots) work to solve the challenge.<br/>Even High is "
"usually solved in under a second on a recent computer; on older phones it "
"can take a few seconds. High is roughly 2–3× the work of Low."
msgstr ""
"Khetha ubunzima be-PoW be-widget: ngokuba ubunzima buyanda, kuthatha ixesha "
"elide abavakasheli (kunye neebots) ukusombulula umbuzo.<br/>Nokuba i-High "
"idla ngokusombululwa ngaphantsi kweyure enye kwi-computer entsha; kwiifoni "
"ezindala kungathatha iisekondi ezimbalwa. I-High yimalunga ne-2–3× "
"yomsebenzi we-Low."

#: includes/settings.php:486
msgid "Expiration"
msgstr "Ukuphela kwexesha"

#: includes/settings.php:497
msgid "Disabled in Custom mode: the backend sets the challenge expiry."
msgstr "Icinyiwe kwi-Custom mode: i-backend isetinga uxolo lokuphela lombuzo."

#: includes/settings.php:500
msgid ""
"Life-span of a challenge. Custom accepts 0 to 14400 seconds, where 0 means "
"no expiry and 14400 is 4 hours."
msgstr ""
"Ixesha lokuphila lombuzo. I-Custom yamkela 0 ukuya ku-14400 zee-sekondi, "
"apho 0 kuthetha ukuba akukho kuphela kwexesha kwaye 14400 yiiyure ezine."

#: includes/settings.php:502
msgid ""
"Above 300 seconds the window in which a solved challenge can be replayed "
"grows, though Replay limit still bounds how often one is accepted. Below 60 "
"seconds a challenge can expire before a slow device finishes solving it, and "
"0 means it never expires at all — both are discouraged and are being "
"evaluated for deprecation."
msgstr ""
"Ngaphaya kwe-300 zee-sekondi, ifestile apho umbuzo osombululiweyo unga-"
"sebenziswa kwakhona iyanda, nangona i-Replay limit isabala ukuba "
"zingezimbalwa ezizithodileyo. Ngaphantsi kwe-60 zee-sekondi, umbuzo "
"ungaphela phambi kokuba isixhobo esicothayo sigqibe ukusombulula, kwaye 0 "
"kuthetha ukuba awupheli konke — zombini azicetyhiswa kwaye zihlola ukuba "
"zisutshwe."

#: includes/settings.php:508
msgid "Replay limit"
msgstr "I-Replay limit"

#: includes/settings.php:514
msgid ""
"How many times one solved challenge may be accepted. This applies in both "
"API Modes."
msgstr ""
"Mangaki amaxesha umbuzo omnye osombululiweyo ungaqatshelwa. Oku kusebenza "
"kwi-API Modes zombini."

#: includes/settings.php:516
msgid ""
"A visitor whose form comes back with an unrelated error (a missing field, a "
"mistyped password) resubmits the same challenge, so a small allowance keeps "
"those submissions working; every extra use is also one more replay available "
"to a bot. Custom accepts 0 to 100, where 0 accepts a solved challenge for as "
"long as it is valid — the behaviour of releases before 1.29.0, and not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Umvakasheli osefomu lwakhe libuyela naye ne-error engahambelani (i-field "
"engekhoyo, i-password ebhalwe ngempazamo) uthumela kwakhona umbuzo ofanayo, "
"ngoko ke uvumelelo oluncinci lugcina izicelo ezo zisebenza; ukusebenzisa "
"okongezelelwe kukuphatha okanye ukunika i-bot elinye i-replay. I-Custom "
"yamkela 0 ukuya ku-100, apho 0 yamkela umbuzo osombululiweyo ngethuba "
"lisebenza — oku kukuphatha kwe-releases phambi kwe-1.29.0, kwaye "
"akucetyhiswa."

