"esabelwana, kwi-database, kwaye ukufaka kwakhona kamva kuziphinda "
"kuzisebenzise. Idatha yethutyana (izibali ze-replay, ukujonga okugciniweyo "
"kwi-cache) isoloko isuswa. Ukuyeka ukusebenza kwe-plugin akuze kususe nto."

